BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Vallejo Open Studios at MIAS
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T170000
UID:261113YggdEmEtJEGnPcQqKAT66w
DESCRIPTION:Once a year\, artists across Vallejo open their doors and invi
 te the community into the places where the work actually happens.\n\nFor V
 allejo Open Studios\, Mare Island Art Studios will be filled with art\, co
 nversation\, works in progress\, finished pieces\, and plenty to discover.
  MIAS resident artists will be joined by guest artists for a weekend that 
 brings together a wide range of mediums\, styles\, and creative practices 
 under one roof.\n\nWander through the studios\, step into our galleries\, 
 meet the artists behind the work\, and see what catches your eye. You may 
 find paintings\, sculpture\, ceramics\, mixed media\, textiles\, illustrat
 ion\, handmade objects and things that don’t fit neatly into any categor
 y at all.\n\nThat’s part of what we love about Open Studios: you never q
 uite know what you’ll find until you walk through the door.\n\nWhether y
 ou’re looking for original art\, curious about how things are made\, wan
 t to meet local artists\, or simply feel like spending an afternoon surrou
 nded by creativity\, come explore Mare Island Art Studios as part of this 
 year’s citywide Vallejo Open Studios.\n\nFree and open to all.
LOCATION:Mare Island Art Studios
URL:https://mareislandartstudios.com/events/mare-island-open-studios/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
