 et them know your list is waiting! ​​🛒🛍️✨\n\n​​🍷 Enjo
 y refreshments and wine while you shop around\, groove to holiday tunes wi
 th us\, and get a head start on your holiday shopping. 🎶\n\n🎁 All gu
 ests will receive a raffle ticket to win a prize.\n\nMake a wishlist to ge
 t 20% off your purchase EXCLUSIVELY during the Sip and Shop Party! 🏷️
  🎄
