DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T150000
UID:261029JJTE458vL0Wit8PTJiIJgw
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a cozy\, hands-on afternoon celebrating the colors
  and textures of the autumn season at our gorgeous Apple Cottage. We are t
 hrilled to partner with the botanical experts from Flower Casita in Petalu
 ma to guide you through crafting your very own holiday masterpiece.\n\nUsi
 ng an array of fresh seasonal greens\, vibrant autumn leaves\, and rich bo
 tanical textures\, you will learn step-by-step techniques to construct a s
 tunning\, festive wreath. Your beautiful creation will be complete and rea
 dy to take home—perfectly timed to hang on your door and welcome guests 
 for your Thanksgiving festivities!\n\nThe experience also includes a guide
 d tour of our farm aboard our apple trolley. To keep things festive and wa
 rm\, you'll be treated to a slice of freshly baked apple pie and a mug of 
 warm apple cider.
LOCATION:Gold Ridge Organic Farms
URL:https://www.exploretock.com/gold-ridge-organic-farms/event/628976/fest
 ive-wreath-making-class-with-flower-casita
