DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T193000
UID:261026ug1owSVeZE23RaNUazAKpA
DESCRIPTION:Join Artem for a special beginner-friendly cha-cha workshop! L
 earn rhythm\, footwork\, and a fun\, upbeat combination inspired by his ex
 perience on Dancing with the Stars. No previous cha-cha experience is need
 ed.\n\nDATE: November 14\, 2026\n\nTIME: 6:30 pm – 7:30 pm\n\nAbout Arte
 m: Artem Chigvintsev is an internationally recognized professional dancer\
 , Emmy-nominated choreographer\, and Dancing with the Stars champion. With
  years of experience performing\, competing\, and teaching\, Artem brings 
 his passion for Latin and ballroom dance to students of all levels. Known 
 for his engaging teaching style and attention to technique\, Artem makes l
 earning to dance both fun and approachable.
