BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fitness Is Better Together: Community Meetup hosted by Kae Method
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261114T120000
UID:261022IRXB2-rVnk23mqYx8qeceA
DESCRIPTION:Fitness is better when we do it together!\n\nJoin us for the f
 irst **Kae Method Community Meetup**\, a free outdoor fitness experience d
 esigned to bring people together through movement\, encouragement\, and me
 aningful connections.\n\nWhether you're just beginning your fitness journe
 y\, getting back into a routine\, or already enjoy working out\, this even
 t is for you. Coach Kae will lead an accessible\, full-body workout featur
 ing strength\, mobility\, and functional movements\, with options for diff
 erent fitness levels and abilities. You can participate at your own pace w
 hile enjoying the energy and encouragement of exercising alongside others.
 \n\nThis is also an opportunity to meet new people\, build friendships\, a
 nd become part of a growing fitness community right here in Santa Rosa.\n\
 nCome on your own\, bring a friend\, or invite someone who could use a lit
 tle extra motivation. We'll create opportunities to connect throughout the
  experience\, with time afterward to relax\, socialize\, and get to know o
 ne another.\n\nWhat to Expect\n\n**An accessible\, coach-led workout:** A
  full-body fitness experience with modifications and challenges for differ
 ent ability levels.\n\n**Supportive coaching:** Guidance and encouragemen
 t from Kae to help you move with confidence.\n\n**Community connections:**
  Opportunities to meet people\, encourage one another\, and build relatio
 nships.\n\n**A welcoming environment:** No matter your fitness experience
 \, you'll have a place here.\n\nWhat to Bring\n\nWear comfortable workout 
 clothes and supportive athletic shoes. Bring water\, a towel\, and an exer
 cise mat if you have one.\n\nEvent Details\n\n**Date:** Saturday\, Novemb
 er 14\, 2026\n\n**Time:** 10:00 AM\n\n**Location:** Finley Community Par
 k\, Santa Rosa\, California\n\n**Cost:** Free\n\n**Who Can Attend:** Adu
 lts 18+ of all fitness experience levels\n\nRegistration is required becau
 se space is limited.\n\nAll participants will be asked to sign a liability
  waiver before joining the workout. Please arrive a few minutes early to c
 omplete check-in.\n\nReserve your spot and join us as we kick off the Kae 
 Method Community!\n\n**Let's move together\, grow stronger\, and stay conn
 ected.**
LOCATION: Finley Community Park
URL:https://www.kaemethod.com/event-details/fitness-is-better-together-com
 munity-meetup-hosted-by-kae-method
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
