UID:261113rG-LXpAW1Eii0xKZbyeNfQ
DESCRIPTION:The Holiday Cocktail Master Class with St. George Spirits brin
 gs seasonal flavors to POST Tasting Lounge through festive cocktail demons
 trations and guided tastings. Two sessions are offered\, each featuring a 
 different selection of holiday-inspired drinks.    The November 14 class e
 xplores the perfect martini and spiced pear cider\, featuring St. George g
 ins and Spiced Pear Liqueur. The December 19 session focuses on espresso m
 artinis and citrus punch\, followed by a tasting of St. George whiskey.   
  Both classes include guided tastings\, take-home cocktail recipe cards\, 
 and a picnic lunch from Market with a choice of sandwich\, chips\, a Carne
 ros cookie\, and boxed water. Guests also receive an exclusive 10% discoun
 t on St. George Spirits purchases.    Classes take place November 14 and D
 ecember 19\, from 10:30 a.m. to 12:30 p.m.
