UID:2611131mgL06X2S0uN_c6fU9qdiw
DESCRIPTION:During a sound bath\, the vibrations produced by the instrumen
 ts can help activate the parasympathetic nervous system and induce a state
  of deep relaxation. This can help reduce stress and anxiety\, improve sle
 ep\, and enhance overall well-being. The sound vibrations can also help re
 lease tension and blockages in the body\, allowing for a greater sense of 
 ease and relaxation. Sound Bath will be led by Modern Alchemy. Space is ve
 ry limited\;  click here to register.
