BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Nov & Dec Artwalks: "Moments in the Light"  Plein Air Painting
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T113000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T143000
UID:261110zVw0vsSPJ0C_zVcPlEsaJQ
DESCRIPTION:Plein Air painting is painting on location responding to the e
 nvironment as it moves you. For us it’s not about the details or exact c
 haracteristics of a location but rather the interaction of color\, the atm
 osphere\, the feeling of standing out there. It's about the immediate mome
 nt of seeing which is in the brushwork of several of the artists\, creatin
 g a dialogue with the space as you make the marks and see how they corresp
 ond to what's in front of you. There is no right or wrong because it is a 
 very personal moment. It's not impressionism. It's not quite expressionism
 . But it's the immediacy of being alive. \n\nMost of the paintings were d
 one when Barry convinced one of the other artists to come painting with hi
 m. Creating a synergy from the overlapping influence on each other while k
 eeping a distinct POV.
LOCATION:McCune Collection
URL:http://www.mccunecollection.org
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Healing Hearts -  A Healing Sip & Paint Experience
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T150000
UID:261110Dv95PP6b10KuG7_DPpgiJw
DESCRIPTION:Healing Hearts by JassverArt is more than a paint class - it's
  a creative experience designed to help you relax\, reconnect\, and create
  from the heart. Begin with a gentle guided meditation\, then paint your o
 wn beautiful wooden heart with step-by-step instruction. No experience is 
 necessary - just bring an open heart. Gather with friends\, enjoy the beau
 tiful atmosphere at Vino Godfather Winery\, and leave with a one-of-a-kind
  piece of art and a peaceful heart.\n\nYour first glass of wine\, of your 
 choice\, is included with admission. All art supplies will be provided. Br
 ing your own protective covering if you'd like. Charcuterie items and othe
 r snacks will be available for purchase\, along with additional wine by th
 e glass or bottle. There will be a short break to replenish drinks and gra
 b snacks.\n\nSpace is limited to 20 guests. Class will take place in backy
 ard venue\, dress accordingly\, evenings can be cool.
LOCATION:Vino Godfather
URL:https://events.vinogodfather.com/healing-hearts-4/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
