DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261115T180000
UID:261108CZk_aUr9dE6gPwSvsRrBuA
DESCRIPTION:**St. Paul's Director of Music Paul Blanchard plays the Bigelo
 w pipe organ to accompany the St. Paul's Choir and Wind Ensemble in a Hymn
  Festival and Choral Concert at 5 p.m. Sunday\, Nov. 15. Hear and sing fav
 orite hymns such as "The Church is One Foundation\," "Come\, You Thankful 
 People\," "Great Is Thy Faithfulness\," "Lift High the Cross" and "Rejoice
  the Lord is  King." There is no admission fee\, and the public is welcom
 e to attend. Those who cannot attend in person may watch the concert onlin
 e by visiting www.stpauls-healdsburg.org/sunday\\_organ\\_series and click
 ing the link to the church's YouTube channel.**
LOCATION:St. Paul's Episcopal Church
URL:http://www.stpauls-healdsburg.org/sunday_organ_series
