DESCRIPTION:Join us for our annual Hanukkah Holiday Faire.\n\nShopping & G
 ifts: Visit the Sisterhood gift shop\, browse through a variety of assorte
 d vendors\, check out the Pixie Emporium\, and take advantage of our gift-
 wrapping services.\n\nFood & Treats: Enjoy festive Hanukkah treats from th
 e bake sale and a nosh at the Bagel Cafe.\n\nFamily-Friendly Atmosphere: A
  vibrant community day designed to help you stock up on holiday items\, pr
 epare your home\, and get into the holiday spirit before Hanukkah begins o
 n Friday\, December 4\, 2026.
LOCATION:Congregation B'nai Israel
