BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:EAMES & EAMES: Meet the couple who Defined Modern Design
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T170000
UID:261004Rl9mWMxU60OmCYCpTEFwwQ
DESCRIPTION:EAMES & EAMES: Meet the couple who Defined Modern Design\n\nCr
 eated in collaboration with the Eames Institute of Infinite Curiosity.\n\n
 EAMES & EAMES explores the iterative\, hands-on\, and human-centered appr
 oach of Charles & Ray Eames. Through furniture\, toys\, paintings\, graphi
 cs\, and personal belongings collected over their lifetimes\, this groundb
 reaking exhibition looks beyond the iconic Eames chairs to reveal the brea
 dth of their creative practice. More than any single object\, their work o
 pened doors to new and unexpected ways of seeing\, thinking\, making\, and
  understanding the world—ideas that continue to inspire us today.\n\nCur
 ated by Llisa Demetrios\, Co-Founder & The Lucia Eames Chief Curator of th
 e Eames Institute of Infinite Curiosity.
LOCATION:The MAC - Napa Valley Museum of Art & Culture
URL:https://napavalleymuseum.org/blogs/upcoming-exhibitions/eames-eames
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Santa Rosa Taco Tuesday Bike Ride
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T000000
UID:260504TqYHso7muE6gRbuvoAm7mg
DESCRIPTION:A fun community bike ride through the heart of Santa Rosa. Com
 e join us this Tuesday! We roll through the JC and McDonald Ave neighborho
 od\, stop in Courthouse Square\, then on to the taco trucks at Mitote Food
  Park in Roseland for dinner! We depart Mitote at 8:15pm\, ride back throu
 gh Courthouse Square\, then on to Yogurt Farms for dessert. This ride is 8
  miles round trip and rides all year long. Rides canceled for rain and hol
 idays. All riders welcome. Bring the whole family! Meet at SRJC parking lo
 t at 550 Silva Ave. We are renting the use of this parking lot every Tuesd
 ay from 5:30pm to 9:30 pm. Taco Tuesday riders can park in the lot during 
 that time frame for free. Please park cars along the back wall on the east
  side. And stage in the row on the northern side of the lot \\(closest to 
 Silva Ave\\). Meet at 5:30pm\; pedals up at 6pm.
LOCATION:SRJC Parking Lot
URL:https://www.visitsantarosa.com/events/#jlupcoming-events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lecture Two | The Social Sculpture: How Art Can Shape Society
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T210000
UID:261114d_sinjEbjkmy9idp9rp58g
DESCRIPTION:As part of the 2-week art exhibition\, STIMULANT\, Apocalypse 
 Studio presents the 2nd lecture in their 2-part series.\n\nThe studio’s 
 founder spent many years working with leaders in twenty countries on some 
 of humanity’s toughest social challenges\, from war and poverty to the d
 estruction of nature\, drug abuse\, immigration\, and violence. He will sh
 are his insights from these years\, focusing on why only the domain of cul
 ture can rebalance systemic breakdown and social decay. He will introduce 
 what he calls the "8th great art"\, Social Sculpture\, to add to the 7 alr
 eady known (Painting\, Sculpture\, Literature\, Architecture\, Theater\, F
 ilm\, and Music). Social Sculpture is the art form of artfully co-creating
  society actively and together.
LOCATION:Laguna Lab
URL:https://apocalypse.art/stimulant/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Belly Dancing with Raja - Tuesdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261117T120000
UID:261107Qavc14wJ506sgPUAbrhAvg
DESCRIPTION:DATE AND TIME: Tuesdays @ 11:00 AM\n\nUnlock your inner streng
 th and find your flow. Belly dancing with Raja is an innovative fusion cl
 ass that blends the rhythmic artistry of belly dance with the high-energ
 y benefits of aerobics. Designed to be both a cardiovascular challenge an
 d a deep toning session\, this class focuses on the “powerhouse” of th
 e body—your core.\n\nBy layering fluid\, isolative movements over an ath
 letic aerobic base\, you will challenge your muscles in ways traditional g
 ym workouts can’t reach.\n\nWhat to Expect in Belly Dancing Class\n\n•
  Core-Centric Power: Use undulations and shimmies to engage deep abdomina
 l muscles for a tighter\, stronger midsection.\n\n• Functional Stability
 : Improve your balance and posture through controlled\, hip-driven moveme
 nts and low-impact aerobic footwork.\n\n• Total Body Toning: Build lean
  muscle in your legs\, glutes\, and arms while maintaining a constant\, he
 art-pumping pace.\n\n• Mind-Body Connection: Enhance your coordination 
 and body awareness through rhythmic\, expressive choreography.\n\n“Wheth
 er you’re looking to define your waistline or simply want a workout that
  feels like a celebration\, this class offers the perfect balance of sweat
  and grace.”\n\nDifficulty Level: All levels welcome! No prior dance ex
 perience is required—just bring your energy and a willingness to move.
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-2/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
