SUMMARY:Les Claypool
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T160000
UID:261031-taGdbFk9kGO24jk3y3Exg
DESCRIPTION:Leslie Edward &quot\;Les&quot\; Claypool is a bassist and lead
  singer\, best known for his work with the alternative rock band Primus. B
 orn on September 29\, 1963\, in Richmond\, California\, Claypool's mastery
  of the electric bass has brought him into the spotlight with his funky\, 
 creative playing style. Though he cites bass virtuoso Geddy Lee of Rush\, 
 and the experimental group The Residents as his greatest influence\, Clayp
 ool is known to use various styles in his playing\, Claypool mixes finger-
 tapping\, flamenco-like strumming\, and a Larry Graham-like slap technique
  to develop his own unique style.  Claypool has earned respect as one of R
 ock's premier bass talents and has become an influence on younger bassists
  in recent years. He has played with other artists such as Tom Waits and B
 uckethead.
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/1040621527?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=2
 87&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Pi Jacobs\, Ben Musser & Walker Young at The Lost Church Santa Ros
 a
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T223000
UID:261028A_k5Q7szLEeunt7ApzQCPw
DESCRIPTION:**Pi Jacobs** draws inspiration from her unconventional upbrin
 ging in Northern California\, where she was raised by “radical hippies\,
  bohemians and nerds”.   She is signed to LA’s Blackbird Record Label
 \, and her 2024 album\, “Soldier On”\, was on the Americana Music Asso
 ciation Chart top 50 upon release in 2024\, and stayed there for over 16 w
 eeks.  \n\nPi has released two new topical singles in 2026. Mrs. Nobody\,
  a powerful ballad with references to to the SAVES act\, limiting married 
 women’s right to vote\, and Nogales\, a song chronicling racial profilin
 g at the Mexican-American  border\, via a personal experience. “I was h
 aving trouble writing\, until I started writing about it head on”. The s
 inger-songwriter states\, with regards to the political nature of her new 
 music.  She is currently recording her next album\, which will include No
 gales\, Mrs. Nobody\, and other songs that reflect on the current experien
 ce of living in the US.  Nogales has been receiving airplay on Sirius XM\
 , The Village\, as of July 2026\n\nhttps://PiJacobs.com  https://Facebook
 .com/PiJacobsMusic      https://Instagram.com/PiJacobs    https://www
 .youtube.com/PiJacobsMusic\n\n**Ben Musser & Walker Young** make up a root
 s power-duo from Jackson Hole\, Wyoming who perform vocally driven soul an
 d country music. Young (of Truth & Salvage Co.) performs accordion\, keybo
 ards and vocals and Musser (formerly Benyaro) performs guitars\, drums\, a
 nd vocals. The duo is promoting Musser’s new solo album ‘Sentimental F
 ever’ (Blackbird Record Label) that's been featured on CMT\, NPR\, EARMI
 LK\, Visual Atelier 8\, and receiving AAA radio play across the country. M
 usser and Young are currently recording their premiere EP at Musser's stud
 io in Jackson Hole. Passionate performances\, boot-stomping joy\, and seas
 oned vocals that move both themselves and others to sing and feel the emot
 ion\, explain the Ben Musser & Walker Young live music performance experie
 nce. https://www.instagram.com/benmussermusichttps://www.facebook.com/ben
 mussermusicahttps://www.tiktok.com/@benmussermusic
LOCATION:The Lost Church
URL:https://thelostchurch.my.salesforce-sites.com/ticket/#/instances/a0FUh
 00000DV2CXMA1
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
