UID:261023M7gnhP8V1EuXiTcRk1BN3w
DESCRIPTION:Susan Topf’s Yoga Hike balances a mix of easy hiking and gen
 tle yoga postures\, breath work and guided meditation\, no mat necessary. 
 The route varies on weather conditions and group interest\, typically cove
 ring 2-3 miles of varied terrain. All levels and ages welcome.\n\nTickets 
 are $20. Please wear weather-appropriate clothing to feel comfortable bein
 g in a natural setting and bring water (as needed). Meet outside the Visit
 or Center unless otherwise noted in the reminder email prior to the hike. 
 Limited to 12 participants. \n\nSonoma County Resident? Free with a Septe
 mber 2026 or newer Park Rx from a participating Sonoma County Medical Prov
 ider. To sign up with a Park Rx\, please forward a PDF of your signed Rx t
 o alma@sonomaecologycenter.org for a sign up code.
LOCATION:Sugarloaf Ridge State Park
URL:https://sec.regfox.com/2026yoga-hikes
