BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Booked & Bottled: Build a Blind Date with a Book at Coursey Graves
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261121T170000
UID:261013HwlVMXYdIEG-nT5eAFnDkQ
DESCRIPTION:Taste your way to a book you’ve never read: Coursey Graves p
 ours a flight of wines\, each one paired to a genre\, and the pour you lov
 e points you toward your blind date with a book.\n\nChardonnay points towa
 rd historical fiction\, Sonoma Coast Pinot Noir toward romantasy\, Syrah t
 oward contemporary fiction\, ‘22 Napa Cabernet toward thriller \\(exact 
 pairings may shift slightly by the day of the event\\). The books are a cu
 rated selection of new releases across all of those genres\, so you’ll g
 et a few clues along the way\, enough to feel confident you’re walking a
 way with something you’ll genuinely like.\n\nFollow your favorite pour t
 o its genre\, then build your blind date: choose from book-themed baubles 
 \\(bookmarks\, stickers\, tea\, and more\\) to tuck inside\, wrap it all u
 p yourself\, and add a pairing card explaining why that book and that wine
  belong together. The book itself stays a mystery until you’re home and 
 ready to unwrap it.\n\nYour ticket includes a full glass of wine plus your
  flight of pours\, food from Coursey Graves\, your wrapped blind-date book
  and baubles to take home\, fun bookish games\, and a spot at the book swa
 p. Add-on blind dates are available if you want to build a second one! One
  bookish blind date is good\, but it also makes a great holiday gift for s
 omeone else on your list.\n\nCoursey Graves’ standard tasting runs $75. 
 For $60\, this ticket gets you wine\, food\, access to a great community o
 f readers\, a book matched to your favorite pour\, and an afternoon built 
 around all four.\n\n$60 general admission\, $45 for Novel Pairings Book Cl
 ub or Coursey Graves Wine Club members. Only 50 tickets available. Come so
 lo\, bring a friend\, or round up your book club\; most people leave havin
 g swapped recommendations with someone new. 21\\+.
LOCATION:Coursey Graves Estate Winery
URL:https://www.novel-pairings.com/bookedbottled
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
