BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Art Opening at Reichwage Winery: Paintings and Artisan Wood Creati
 ons
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T130000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261122T160000
UID:261112bYg0KJJE6Ue45AdHam-AJg
DESCRIPTION:Join us for an afternoon celebrating art\, nature\, and creati
 vity with local artists Jann Aanestad and Ken Hower. Meet the artists\, ex
 plore their work\, and enjoy light bites in the lovely setting of Reichwag
 e Winery. Wine by the glass and tastings will also be available for purcha
 se.\n\nResilience | Jann Aanestad\n\nJann's colorful paintings capture the
  beauty of nature\, the stories held in familiar places\, and quiet moment
 s in everyday life. Inspired by her own remarkable journey of recovery and
  renewal\, her work celebrates resilience\, the transformative power of li
 ght\, and the beauty that surrounds us.\n\nShaped by Nature | Ken Hower\n\
 nKen creates beautiful artisan woodwork\, transforming walnut\, oak\, manz
 anita\, and olive into one-of-a-kind bowls\, platters\, boards\, and decor
 ative art. His pieces celebrate the natural grain\, rich textures\, and fl
 owing organic shapes of wood\, highlighting the unique character and beaut
 y of each piece.\n\nCome for the art\, stay for the atmosphere\, and disco
 ver the hidden gem that is Reichwage Winery.
LOCATION:Reichwage Winery
URL:https://www.reichwage.com/upcoming-events
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
