 irait-on" by Morten Lauridsen\, "Chorale: Hymn" by Karl Jenkins\, "I'll be
  Seeing You" by Habermann and Fain\, "Ad Astra" by Narverud\, "Time after 
 Time" by Cyndi Lauper\, "O Love" by Elaine Hagenberg\, "The Awakening" by 
 Martin and more!\n\nWe are so thrilled to be returning to the Barrel Room.
