DESCRIPTION:Thanksgiving is coming... and lucky for you\, we have a Thanks
 giving Camp!\n\nFrom November 23rd to 25th \\(Mon-Wed\\)\, we'll offer a d
 ay camp that keeps kids learning\, moving\, and making friends. We'll do s
 easonal crafts\, play games\, build forts\, and even play outside if the w
 eather allows. All while learning gymnastics basics sure to entertain both
  girls and boys of any skill level.\n\nThis camp is for ages 4-12\, and ru
 ns from 8:30 AM-2:30 PM.\n\nYou can enroll online through our Parent Porta
 l \\(account creation required\\):\n\nhttps://app.fulloutsoftware.com/sono
 ma-gymnastics-academy/sign-in\n\nOR\n\nCall us at \\(707\\) 343-1402 and w
 e'll enroll you over the phone!\n\nKeep your kids off the couch during Tha
 nksgiving Break and send them to Sonoma Gymnastics Academy!
