SUMMARY:One on One Tech Help
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261124T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261124T180000
UID:261107p4Fmc4B9nkClQB677DKA7Q
DESCRIPTION:Have a nagging tech question? Need help borrowing an eBook? Wh
 at about setting up an email account? Drop in for up to 30-minutes with a 
 Petaluma Reference Librarian for one-on-one assistance. Please note we are
  not IT experts\, but we will do our best to assist you or else refer you 
