DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261126T000000
UID:261111y1RU-OeDREmzBKf924aBOg
DESCRIPTION:Thanksgiving at Songbird Parlour in Glen Ellen offers a festiv
 e holiday dining experience in a historic 1839 Victorian setting. Guests c
 an celebrate with two special dining opportunities. Thanksgiving Eve\, Wed
 nesday\, November 25\, 2026\, from 5-9 p.m.\, features the restaurant's po
 pular Prime Rib Night\, with slow-roasted prime rib\, seasonal sides\, hor
 seradish\, au jus\, and chives. The regular menu will also be available. O
 n Thanksgiving Day\, Thursday\, November 26\, 2026\, from 1-4 p.m.\, guest
 s can enjoy an à la carte menu along with seasonal chef specials\, making
  it easy to celebrate without spending the holiday in the kitchen. Reserva
 tions are recommended\, as holiday tables are expected to fill quickly.
LOCATION:Songbird Parlour
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/thanksgiving-at-songbird-parlour/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
