DESCRIPTION:The Santa Rosa Turkey Trot brings the community together on Th
 anksgiving morning for a festive run through downtown Santa Rosa. Starting
  at Old Courthouse Square\, participants can enjoy a 5K race or the Tiny T
 urkey dash for children under five. The route winds through downtown and a
 long the Santa Rosa Creek\, offering a fun way for runners\, walkers\, and
  families to celebrate the holiday. Costumes are welcome\, and participant
 s can look forward to finisher medals and awards. The annual event also su
 pports the Redwood Empire Food Bank\, helping fight food insecurity throug
 hout Sonoma County. The race takes place rain or shine.
