DESCRIPTION:Get ready to kick off the holiday season with a magical tree l
 ighting experience.\n\nJoin us for our second Annual Tree Lighting Celebra
 tion in The Courtyard near Monti’s and Salt & Straw from 5pm-7pm!\n\nKic
 k off the holiday season with an evening full of festive fun for the whole
  family as we gather for our first annual tree lighting celebration at Mon
 tgomery Village.\n\nFree and open to the community — come celebrate the 
 season with us! Register here.\n\nEnjoy a festive evening filled with holi
 day music\, creative activities\, and a special appearance by Santa and Mr
 s. Claus. Admission is free\, with seasonal fun for the whole family:\n\n-
  Live holiday music and carolers\, plus a family-friendly holiday singalon
 g at 6:45 p.m.\n\n- Complimentary hot cocoa\n\n- Churros and cookies avail
 able for purchase\n\n- Complimentary caricature portraits\n\n- Custom wood
 -burned gift tags\n\n- Make-your-own mini snowmen and jingle bell wreath o
 rnaments\n\n- Write your letters to Santa\, delivered through the official
  Montgomery Village Santa Mail mailbox\n\n- A special visit from Santa and
  Mrs. Claus\n\nMake the evening a little sweeter with a stop at Salt & Str
 aw. During the event\, enjoy a complimentary scoop with the purchase of a 
 scoop\, available November 28\, 2026\, from 5–7 p.m.
