BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Country Line Dancing Night ft. Dustin Saylor & The Stowaways
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T190000
UID:261022hQ21Bdb7nESUmafn55RGGA
DESCRIPTION:**Date:** Saturday\, November 28\, 2026\n\n**Time:** Doors 6 
 PM | Lessons 7-8 PM | Live music throughout the night\n\n**Tickets:** $20 
 Advance | $25 Door | Coyote Sonoma Members Receive $5 Off\n\nJoin us for l
 ine dancing lessons from Grapevine Dance! Plus live music from Dustin Sayl
 or & The Stowaways.\n\nAbout Dustin Saylor:\n\nDustin Saylor\, a Northern 
 California-born country singer-songwriter\, has made a name for himself as
  the #1 Country/Folk artist in the San Francisco Bay Area. His musical jou
 rney began in childhood\, first at the piano and later as a guitarist and 
 singer for his high school youth group and local church. Despite early cha
 llenges\, including a devastating American Idol rejection in 2009\, Saylor
  had a transformative moment on his long drive home\, realizing that true 
 success required full commitment. Embracing his calling\, he quit bartendi
 ng\, pursued a music degree at Sonoma State University\, and became a full
 -time musician. Over the years\, he has performed alongside artists like T
 yler Rich\, Chase Rice\, and Daughtry\, with his sound often compared to T
 homas Rhett and Chris Stapleton. His songwriting is deeply personal\, shap
 ed by his early experiences of adoption and the contrasting struggles and 
 joys of his life. Through his music\, Saylor seeks to inspire\, heal\, and
  create a space where people can connect beyond labels. Committed to his c
 raft\, he remains "all in\," determined to sing and play music for the res
 t of his life.
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/country-line-dancing-with-dustin-saylor-
 -the-stowaways-1128-p270.aspx
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
