BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Touching the Earth: Dharma and Yoga
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261128T150000
UID:261012gQRUqmDZukG5wFxcnDpi9A
DESCRIPTION:with Djuna Devereaux and Rolf Gates\n\nWhen stress and uncerta
 inty arise\, returning to the body and our connection with the earth offer
 s stability\, calm\, and the possibility of a wise response. In this daylo
 ng retreat\, we’ll cultivate embodied presence as a taproot—grounding 
 us and settling the mind. From this refuge\, we’ll explore opening to cl
 arity\, joy\, and belonging.\n\nOur day will weave together Dharma teachin
 gs\, meditation\, somatic movement\, and yoga asana into a deeply nourishi
 ng experience. We’ll begin with floor-based movement to release tension 
 and fatigue\, then flow into accessible yoga sequences. Drawing on persona
 l stories and classical Buddhist teachings\, we’ll explore what it means
  to be grounded in the body\, held by awareness\, and supported by communi
 ty. All abilities and levels of experience warmly welcomed!
LOCATION:Spirit Rock Meditation Center
URL:https://spirit-rock.secure.retreat.guru/program/touching-the-earth-dha
 rma-and-yoga-dj3d26/?lang=en
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
