BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Taste of Italy at Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T170000
UID:260430F51ZeVxRhUOSYf5QVS5O-A
DESCRIPTION:For wine drinkers eager to experience world-class wines made i
 n California from Italian varieties\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room
  is a must during any trip to Sonoma County. Located just off the plaza in
  the charming town of Healdsburg near famed restaurants\, boutiques and ga
 lleries\, the Centennial Mountain Tasting Room is a destination that invit
 es discovery. Founded by the acclaimed team that guides renowned Pinot Noi
 r and Chardonnay producer Rhys Vineyards\, Centennial Mountain was establi
 shed to explore Italian grape varieties grown on its acclaimed Centennial 
 Mountain Vineyard in the rugged mountains of Northern Sonoma County.\n\nTh
 e Centennial Mountain Vineyard Tasting features the winery’s coveted Neb
 biolo\, and the pioneering Carricante and Nerello Mascalese wines\, among 
 others. To showcase how beautifully the wines pair with food\, the winery 
 also offers a delicious Wine and Sushi Pairing from nearby Asahi Sushi\, o
 ne of Healdsburg’s most popular dining destinations.\n\nGuests can also 
 enhance their tasting experience with a curated salumi board from Journeym
 an Meat Company. This generous accompaniment features six house-made salum
 i\, crostini\, cornichons\, olives\, and a selection of local cheese that 
 serves 2 to 5 guests.
LOCATION:Centennial Mountain Tasting Room 
URL:https://cmvineyard.com/visit/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Meet Me in St. Louis
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261129T163000
UID:261112FSfIK5J1vE2ODc3v5LaTlA
DESCRIPTION:Meet Me in St. Louis is a heartwarming\, nostalgic musical tha
 t brings the charm and excitement of turn-of-the-century America to life. 
 Set in 1904 on the eve of the St. Louis World’s Fair\, the story follows
  the Smith family through a year of romance\, humor\, and unexpected chang
 e. At its center is the spirited and lovestruck Esther Smith\, whose bloss
 oming romance unfolds alongside her sisters’ own adventures and the fami
 ly’s hopes for the future. Featuring beloved songs like “The Trolley S
 ong\,” “Have Yourself a Merry Little Christmas\,” and “The Boy Nex
 t Door\,” this classic musical overflows with warmth\, wit\, and unforge
 ttable melodies. Rich with period detail\, lively ensemble numbers\, and t
 ender family moments\, Meet Me in St. Louis celebrates community\, resilie
 nce\, and the enduring power of home. Audiences will be swept up in its co
 lorful seasonal settings—from summer dances to a magical Christmas Eve
 —culminating in the dazzling anticipation of the World’s Fair. Perfect
  for theatregoers of all ages\, this timeless musical offers romance\, lau
 ghter\, and a joyful reminder that even in times of change\, love and fami
 ly light the way forward. MEET ME IN ST. LOUIS is presented by arrangement
  with Concord Theatricals on behalf of Tams-Witmark LLC. concordtheatrical
 s.com
