DESCRIPTION:At The Duckhorn Collection\, we believe memories are created w
 hen people gather\, share stories\, and truly connect. This wine and food 
 experience is served family-style\, featuring wines from across our portfo
 lio. Each course is designed to inspire exploration and play\, encouraging
  you to mix\, match and savor. You may even uncover an unexpected favorite
  along the way and an idea you can bring home with you!\n\nThis experience
  is offered Thursday through Sunday.\n\n**MENU:**\n\n**GATHER**\n\n2021 Go
 ldeneye Brut Rosé\n\nRoasted Beet Mosaic\n\nFeta\, Squash\, Chickpeas\, &
  Walnuts\n\n2023 Calera Mt. Harlan Chardonnay\n\nBrown Butter Potato Gnocc
 hi\n\nBrussels Sprouts\, Sous-vide Bacon\, Calvados & Sage\n\n2023 Duckhor
 n Rector Creek Merlot\n\n**GRA Z E**\n\nHeirloom Floriani Red Flint Corn P
 olenta\n\nWild Mushrooms and Aged Gouda Cheese\n\n2022 Paraduxx Rector Cre
 ek Cabernet - Zinfandel Blend\n\nSmoked Beef Short Rib\n\nBaby Root Vegeta
 ble Gremolata\n\n2023 Duckhorn Patzimaro Cabernet Sauvignon\n\n**SAVOR**\n
 \nPear Butter Cake\n\nGorgonzola Anglaise\, Spiced Pecans\, Caramel\n\nPai
 ring: 2021 Calera Viognier Doux\n\n\\- Please note this is a 21 and over e
 xperience\n\n\\- Group size: 2-6 guests﻿﻿\n\n\\- Duration: Please allo
 w 90-120 minutes for this experience
LOCATION:The Duckhorn Collection 
URL:https://www.theduckhorncollection.com/pages/culinary
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
