BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Donate to Novato Heroes & Helpers 2026 - Hosted by NPD + NFD
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T080000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261201T080000
UID:261111Q-ZXsjhk2UuJ0deTdkFORA
DESCRIPTION:HEROES & HELPERS 2026: Every year\, the Novato Police Departme
 nt partners with North Marin Community Services\, Novato Fire\, NUSD\, Rot
 ary Club of Novato\, City of Novato and other organizations to assist 60 l
 ocal Novato families in providing gifts for the holiday season. Our hope i
 s to continue to give back to our underserved families and build a stronge
 r bond with our community.  Why Your Support Matters: For many children in
  our community\, the holiday season can bring feelings of uncertainty rath
 er than joy. For a child who might otherwise go without\, this event is so
  much more than receiving a gift\, it’s about walking side-by-side with 
 a local police officer or firefighter\, feeling valued\, and experiencing 
 the overwhelming magic of a community that cares. Your gift turns anxiety 
 into joy and creates uplifting memories that these kids and families carry
  with them for a lifetime. ℹ️ Event & Donation Details: The Event: As 
 in years past\, the event will be hosted at Target\, featuring our excitin
 g school bus escort \\(provided by NUSD\\) to the store starting from Nort
 h Marin Community Services. Our Goal: We are reaching out to our community
  and local businesses who are willing to assist with a donation so we can 
 once again support families in need. Our goal is $7\,500. How to Give: Onl
 ine: Donate directly through our 2026 Heroes & Helpers Donation Link: http
 s://secure.qgiv.com/for/heranhel/ By Mail / In Person: Checks can be sent 
 directly to: North Marin Community Services\, 680 Wilson Ave\, Novato\, CA
  94947 \\(Please note “2026 Heroes & Helpers Event” on the memo line\\
 ) We are deeply grateful for your continued support of this event each yea
 r and wish everyone a safe and wonderful holiday season!
URL:https://www.facebook.com/events/1843125820367620/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
