DESCRIPTION:December 2 – January 6 \\(6 weeks\\)\n\n7:15 PM – 8:15 PM 
 4140 Redwood Highway \\#8\, San Rafael\, CA\n\nReady to take your salsa to
  the next level? This 6-week salsa intermediate Marin series is designed f
 or dancers who already know the basics \\(timing\, basic steps\, and simpl
 e turns\, etc.\\) and want to build the confidence and versatility to shin
 e on the social dance floor.\n\nIn this class\, you’ll:\n\nDevelop adapt
 ability so you can flow with different partners and music.\n\nRefine your 
 footwork and styling for sharper expression.\n\nMaster more complex turn p
 atterns and combinations.\n\nStrengthen your lead and follow for smoother\
 , more connected dancing.\n\nWhat to Expect: Steven’s teaching style ble
 nds structure with fun\, creating a supportive space where you’ll be cha
 llenged but never overwhelmed. Each week builds on the last\, helping you 
 progress steadily while keeping the joy of salsa front and center.\n\nDeta
 ils:\n\nNo partner necessary — rotations ensure everyone gets to dance.\
 n\nPlease wear non-marking shoe soles to protect the floor.\n\nArrive 10
  minutes early to warm up and get settled.\n\nDate & Time: Wednesdays @ 7:
 15PM – 8:15PM\n\nInstructor: Steven Khuong\n\nAddress: 4140 Redwood High
 way \\#8 San Rafael\, CA
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/intermediate-salsa-wednesday-715-pm/
