DESCRIPTION:Potluck\, Round Table Discussion & Elections 12:00 pm at the V
 allejo Naval and Historical Museum \\(not on Zoom\\) This is the Genalogy 
 Society of Vallejo-Benicia Annual POTLUCK Meeting. We will elect the Board
  for 2027. Bring a labeled dish to share for our potluck. Drinks will be p
 rovided. Please note the 12 NOON Start Time at the Vallejo Naval and Histo
 rical Museum. Everyone can share what we have been working on. We can talk
