BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Starman SF - A Night of Bowie at the Mystic Theatre
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T223000
UID:261105NCHw2p7btU2LXs5lAvacYA
DESCRIPTION:Experience the music\, energy\, and theatrical magic of David 
 Bowie as Starman SF welcomes special guest vocalist Randy Cordeiro to the 
 Mystic Theatre on Friday\, December 4.\n\nAn immersive\, authentic concert
  experience\, Starman SF transports you into the world of a David Bowie sh
 ow—celebrating the songs\, sound\, and spirit of one of music’s most e
 xtraordinary artists.\n\nRandy brings extensive experience as a solo artis
 t and frontman\, with remarkable vocal range and a striking ability to cap
 ture the distinctive tone\, phrasing\, and emotion of Bowie’s voice acro
 ss his many musical eras. Paired with Starman SF’s immersive live perfor
 mance\, the effect is transporting—at moments\, you could close your eye
 s and swear you were listening to Bowie himself.\n\nThis is a rare opportu
 nity to experience Randy Cordeiro in a different musical light—and a spe
 cial pre-holiday treat for anyone who loves David Bowie.\n\nJoin us for a 
 night of sound and vision. Let’s dance!\n\n Mystic Theatre • Petaluma
   \n\nFriday\, December 4\, 2026  \n\nDoors: 7:30PM | Show: 8:30PM\n\n 
 Tickets are on sale now!\n\nhttps://www.eventim.us/event/starman-sf/708964
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall
URL:https://www.starmansf.com/events/a-night-of-bowie-at-the-mystic-theatr
 e-special-guest-vocalist-randy-cordeiro
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
