BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Ann Halen + Bad Reputation
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T190000
UID:261022KdTPCvhA902gYkANk46Zfg
DESCRIPTION:**Date:** Friday\, December 4\, 2026\n\n**Time:** Doors 6 PM 
 | Show 7 PM\n\n**Tickets:** $10 Adv | $15 Door | Free for Coyote Sonoma Cl
 ub Members\n\n**Food Vendor:** Smoked & Baked Pizza\n\n**Location:** Coyot
 e Sonoma - 44F Mill Street\, Healdsburg CA\, 95448\n\n**Ann Halen** is a V
 an Halen tribute band hailing from Novato\, California—lead by singer ex
 traordinaire Annie Scherer—dedicated to performing song-for-song album r
 ecreations with note-for note accuracy. The band focuses exclusively on th
 e David Lee Roth era Van Halen tunes\, and has been performing to rave rev
 iews ever since their inception. With an awesome female lead singer and a 
 roster of accomplished\, virtuosic musicians\, they are an amazing tribute
  to one of the greatest bands in rock-and-roll history.\n\n**Bad Reputatio
 n** pays tribute to Joan Jett and the Blackhearts with precision and love
 —all the songs that you want to hear\, plus some that you need to hear.
  \n\nThe musicians behind Bad Reputation have decades of experience\, as 
 well as youthful exuberance.\n\nAs Joan Jett\, RJ Rocket (aka Robin Pfefer
 ) has been a NorCal fixture since the 80s. She's performed with Wild Bride
 s\, Yo! Pizzaface\, No Use For A Name\, Dr. Obvious\, Cheap Date 13\, and 
 more. She's produced records for Cheap Date 13\, Grit & Pluck\, Buzzard\, 
 Megan McElroy\, and others. She brings a true Rock and Roll heart to Bad 
 Reputation.\n\nGuitarist Connor Skünck Jr.- owner of the coolest guitar i
 n the world\, as well as more hair than the rest of the band combined. Def
 initely punches above his weight class.\n\nBassist Kevin “Popeye” Dee 
 - Played trumpet at Katy Perry's sweet 16 birthday\, then a chance encount
 er with Tom Waits convinced him in a roundabout way to play electric bass.
 \n\nDrummer Nicky Thunders -Lives large\, plays big\, plus red beard. What
 's not to love?
LOCATION:Coyote Sonoma
URL:https://shop.coyotesonoma.com/ann-halen-with-bad-reputation-124-p262.a
 spx
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mostly Kosher
