BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bright Nights at Cuvaison
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261204T190000
UID:261110FL87Ss9AqkK9kWb6NB9QcA
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the magic of the holiday season with Bright Nights\,
  an evening wine tasting experience set against one of Cuvaison’s most e
 nchanting backdrops: rows and rows of estate vineyards illuminated with tw
 inkling lights.\n\nOffered Friday\, Saturday\, and Sunday evenings from No
 vember 27 through January 3\, Bright Nights invites you to experience the 
 beauty of wine country after dark as the vineyard comes alive with a warm 
 holiday glow. From 5:00pm to 7:00pm\, settle in for a cozy seasonal tastin
 g featuring a selection of Cuvaison wines served with seasonal cheese and 
 charcuterie pairing.\n\nWhether you’re gathering with friends\, celebrat
 ing the season\, or creating a new holiday tradition\, Bright Nights offer
 s a festive and memorable way to enjoy the estate.\n\nExperience Highlight
 s:\n\n·         Rows of estate vineyards illuminated with twinkli
 ng holiday lights\n\n·         Curated wine and cheese pairings\n
 \n·         Festive evening tasting from 5:00pm to 7:00pm\n\n· 
         A magical seasonal setting for friends and holiday gatherin
 gs\n\nThis special tasting experience is offered Fridays\, Saturdays and S
 undays from November 27 through January 3\, with reservations beginning at
  5:00\, 5:15\, and 5:30pm. Please include all guests in your reservation.\
 n\nCuvaison and Brandlin Estate members receive preferred pricing and will
  see a $35 discount for up to 4 guests applied at checkout. Please use the
  email address where you receive membership updates in order for your disc
 ount to apply.\n\nCuvaison kindly asks that all guests be 21 years of age 
 or older to enjoy this experience (unless otherwise noted for special fami
 ly friendly dates). The patio is closed during Bright Nights\, so Cuvaison
  is not able to accommodate pets.\n\nImportant Dates:\n\nThursday\, Novemb
 er 12 – Industry Event\n\nSaturday\, November 15 – Member Pick-up Even
 t + Holiday Shopping\n\nFriday\, November 27 – Bright Nights Launch + Bl
 ack Friday Specials\n\nThursday\, December 3 – Bright Nights Workshop ev
 ent\n\nSunday\, December 13 – Bright Nights Family Night (includes milk 
 + cookie pairing for kids\, and a holiday activity). This evening may also
  include a photographer offering Holiday Family portraits.\n\nSunday\, Dec
 ember 27 – Bright Nights Family Night (includes milk + cookie pairing fo
 r kids\, and a holiday activity). This evening may also include a photogra
 pher offering Holiday Family portraits.
LOCATION:Cuvaison Estate Tasting Room
URL:https://tewines.com/pages/cuvaison-tastings 
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
