DESCRIPTION:Come support the next generation of entrepreneurs at the Child
 ren’s Business Fair!\n\nYoung entrepreneurs from across Sonoma and Marin
  Counties will bring their business ideas to life\, creating products\, de
 veloping their brands\, setting prices\, and selling directly to customers
  at this one-day marketplace.\n\nMore than a market\, the fair is a hands-
 on learning experience designed to build creativity\, confidence\, financi
 al literacy\, and real-world business skills. Throughout the day\, local b
 usiness leaders and entrepreneurs will visit student booths\, offering enc
 ouragement\, practical advice\, and feedback to help kids think and grow l
 ike business owners.\n\nCome shop\, discover unique kid-created products\,
  and support the next generation of local entrepreneurs!\n\nInterested in 
 launching your own business? Children from throughout Sonoma and Marin Cou
 nties are invited to participate.
