DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261205T190000
UID:2611067fOO56N9JECsP_uybnwsgQ
DESCRIPTION:**Step into Santa Rosa’s premier winter wonderland for the 6
 th Annual *Merry & Bright*!**\n\nPresented by Sonoma Clean Power\, produce
 d by the Redwood Ice Theatre Company (RITC)\, and hosted at iconic Snoopy
 ’s Home Ice\, this cherished holiday tradition returns with nine complet
 ely free outdoor ice skating shows. Gather the family to watch dazzling ro
 utines from professional skaters\, accompanied by classic holiday music an
 d seasonal entertainment designed to bring neighbors together across Sonom
 a and Mendocino counties.\n\nIn the spirit of innovation and sustainabilit
 y\, this year’s outdoor production is powered directly by Sonoma Clean P
 ower’s all-electric Ford F-150 Lightning truck—showcasing clean energy
  in action while helping local households discover easy ways to save energ
 y this winter.\n\n**Admission:** Completely free\, no tickets required!\n\
 n**Location:** Snoopy’s Home Ice\, Santa Rosa\n\n**Show Schedule (9 Free
  Outdoor Performances):**\n\n**Friday\, December 4:** 5:00 p.m. & 6:00 p.m
 .\n\n**Saturday\, December 5:** 2:00 p.m.\, 3:00 p.m.\, 5:00 p.m. & 6:00 p
 .m.\n\n**Sunday\, December 6:** 1:00 p.m.\, 2:00 p.m. & 3:00 p.m.\n\n**Pro
  Tip:** Arrive early to bundle up\, grab a hot cocoa\, and secure the best
  spot to watch the show!\n\nTo learn more about how SCP is giving back thi
 s holiday season\, visit: https://sonomacleanpower.org/holidays
LOCATION:Snoopy's Home Ice
URL:https://sonomacleanpower.org/holidays
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
