UID:261113PaxtwDOnkU-SHdTOLQElJA
DESCRIPTION:Friday–Sunday *◆* December 4–6\, 2026\n\nFree admission\
 n\nOnce a year the center is transformed into a magical winter wonderland\
 , filled to the brim with handmade goods – many of which have been made 
 inside the very walls of the Center.\n\nPeruse over 70 juried artist vendo
 rs ranging in medium including but not limited to ceramics\, fiber arts\, 
 painting\, photography\, jewelry\, metalwork\, woodwork\, and more.\n\nOpe
 ning night\n\nFriday:\n\nDecember 4\n\n4:00 – 7:00 PM\n\nFirst pick of t
 he whole market\, before anything sells out.\n\nBusiest day\n\nSaturday:\n
 \nDecember 5\n\n10:00 AM – 5:00 PM\n\nSeven full hours\, every room open
 \, the most artists on site\n\nEasiest browse:\n\nSunday\n\nDecember 6\n\n
 10:00 AM – 3:00 PM\n\nA slower\, quieter pace and one last chance at the
  good stuff.
