UID:261009RvsqOTwX0UqbH8_YabeNoA
DESCRIPTION:This holiday season\, the Symphony Pops and Pops Conductor Tro
 y Quinn welcome soprano Andrea Ross\, a vocalist celebrated for her brilli
 ant tone and radiant flair\, for the ultimate holiday concert full of joyf
 ul classics\, including “Deck the Halls\,” “Joy to the World\,” 
 “Sleigh Ride\,” and “The Man with the Bag.” Ross’ luminous voice
  and expressive style shine especially bright for this elegantly festive h
 oliday program – with just the right amount of Broadway sparkle to get y
 ou into the holiday spirit.  Generous support provided by Nancy & Mike Hal
 l and Betty and George Ferris
