 painting\, photography\, jewelry\, metalwork\, woodwork\, and more.\n\nOpe
 ning night\n\nFriday:\n\nDecember 4\n\n4:00 – 7:00 PM\n\nFirst pick of t
 he whole market\, before anything sells out.\n\nBusiest day\n\nSaturday:\n
