DESCRIPTION:Stand-up Comedy on Sunday Evenings in Downtown Santa Rosa! 6pm
 ! Free!\n\nOur weekly Sunday Funday comedy show on Sunday Evenings. Comedi
 ans from all over The Bay Area to perform a hilarious free show in the lou
 nge. Wine\, beer\, fun alternative mixed drinks\, you name it. Come early 
 for live music and then stay for karaoke! Your Sundays just got a whole lo
 t funner! 21+ NO COVER Tips encouraged\, but NEVER required. 2 drink minim
 um\, please. Check out **www.BarrelProofLounge.com** for all sorts of good
