UID:261012VkRttNQKFkOga_778vi1ag
DESCRIPTION:Bellydancing for Beginners \n\nDiscover the beauty of Raqs Sh
 arqi \\(bellydance\\). This beginner-friendly class introduces you to fou
 ndational bellydance technique\, including hip movements\, isolations\, un
 dulations\, traveling steps\, combinations and musicality. You’ll develo
 p coordination\, body awareness\, strength\, and confidence while learning
  to move with greater ease and expression.\n\nNo previous dance experience
  is required. All bodies and experience levels are welcome.\n\nCome move t
 o the music\, connect with your body\, and discover the joy of bellydancin
 g\n\nCAREM LOVE\n\nCarem Love is a wellness advocate\, professional dancer
 \, and certified yoga instructor with a Bachelor’s degree in Dance. She 
 has extensive training in Bellydance\, a deep passion for Latin dance\, an
 d is certified in Hatha\, Vinyasa\, and Children’s Yoga.\n\nBelly dance 
 has profoundly supported her health\, well-being\, and dance career\, insp
 iring her to help others experience the same body-mind benefits. In her cl
 asses\, students learn to connect more deeply with themselves.\n\nDATE: Mo
 nday\n\nTIME: 6:00 PM\n\nWHERE: Salsa Dance Marin\, 4140 Redwood Hwy 8\, S
 an Rafael
LOCATION:Salsa Dance Marin
URL:https://salsadancemarin.com/belly-dancing-with-carem/
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
