UID:2610169c5JEkt9Y0-7s-8A1uhpfA
DESCRIPTION:All are welcomed to play\, from beginners to regular players.\
 n\n4 Rounds\, Round Robin \\(PPR\\) to a Single Elimination Playoff. 32\\+
  players: Uppers and Lowers. To check out the winners and shenanigans\, ch
 eck out our 4bagsin Facebook and TikTok channels. https://www.youtube.com/
 @4BagsIn\n\nHalf Time Game: 4BagsIn Rumble\, call the shot! Win a drone! E
 ach shot is 20% of the pot. Boards available for practice at 5:30 p.m. Tra
 ining available for new players. 6:00 PM check-in. 6:30 game starts. All s
 kill levels Welcomed!! No burner accounts.\n\nSign up through Scoreholio\,
  message us on Facebook\, or just show up. $10 Entry Fee
