BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Los Cien Holiday Party: Noche de Gratitud
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261210T200000
UID:261114ttgooyrhSkqeSwnTj8l7KA
DESCRIPTION:Los Cien Holiday Party &ndash\; Noche de Gratitud\n\nA communi
 ty-centered\, family-friendly celebration of Latine culture during the hol
 iday season.\n\nThe year is wrapping up\, and we're celebrating the way we
  know best: together. Our comunidad showed up again and again this year\, 
 and every program and gathering happened because of our volunteers\, membe
 rs\, staff\, partners\, and friends. Now it's our turn to say gracias.\n\n
 Come hang out with the Los Cien familia at Sally Tomatoes in Rohnert Park 
 for appetizers\, karaoke\, and a little friendly holiday competition.\n\nE
 vent Details:\n\nLocation: Sally Tomatoes\n\nAddress: 1100 Valley House Dr
 .\, Rohnert Park\, CA 94928\n\nDate &amp\; Time: Thursday\, December 10 | 
 5:30pm to 8:00pm\n\nRSVP: Space is limited to the first 200 guests &ndash\
 ; reserve your spot early!\n\nCost: Free! \n\nAbout the Bar: This is a no-
 host bar\, so drinks are on your own tab. \n\n\\*\\*\\* The first 50 peopl
 e to RSVP will receive one complimentary drink from Los Cien!\n\nWhat to E
 xpect:\n\nMusic\n\nDelicious appetizers\n\nDecorate-a-puerquito contest\n\
 nKaraoke hosted by DJ Quetzali\n\nFlip cup\n\nAnd more holiday fun!\n\nThi
 s celebration is our way of saying much&iacute\;simas gracias to the volun
 teers\, staff\, members\, and familia who make Los Cien what it is. Bring 
 your holiday spirit and celebrate a year of progress with us. We just want
  to hang out\, celebrate\, and show our gratitude for a community that lif
 ts us all.
LOCATION:Sally Tomatoes
URL:https://mynorthbaytickets.ticketsauce.com/e/loscien-holidayparty-2026?
 aff=cityspark
X-SOURCE:North Bay Bohemian
END:VEVENT
