UID:261031slplw6nblEu0NGTuwljcqQ
DESCRIPTION:iLLuminous Events\n\nShady Oak Brewing Company\n\nSanta Rosa\,
  CA\n\nSaturday\, December 12  •  Starts at 7:30 PM\n\nOverview\n\nDARK 
 EDM HOLIDAY CELEBRATION\n\niLLuminous Events invites you to the 2nd Annual
  Haus of Krampus — an EDM Dark Holiday Celebration & Costume Party!\n\nT
 he creative spark that Halloween inspires doesn’t have to end so soon. S
 tep into the Haus of Krampus for a night of bass-heavy beats\, immersive e
 ntertainment\, and festive mayhem.\n\n👹 Come dressed in your best Kramp
 us-inspired costume! Bring your own horns\, get creative\, and enter our c
 ostume contest for a chance to win prizes.\n\n🎁 Give back this holiday 
 season. We’ll be collecting donations for a local Toy & Food Drive suppo
 rting our Sonoma County community. Bring a new\, unwrapped toy or nonperis
 hable food item to help spread some holiday cheer.\n\n🔊 Featuring Wreck
 no — Detroit-based rapper\, producer\, and DJ Wreckno brings together ba
 ss music\, electronic sounds\, pop culture\, and queer identity to create 
 a beautiful and bizarre experience.\n\nSupported by:\n\nNaughty Princess 
 — Burning Man legend and bass music powerhouse\n\nThug Shells — bass D
 J and bubbly-freestyle rapper\n\nDJ Dyops — LUSH resident DJ\n\n👻 Exp
 ect the unexpected! Scare actors from Blind Scream Haunted House will be r
 oaming throughout the event and interacting with guests\, bringing spooky 
 tricks and treats throughout the night. Get your photo taken with the infa
 mous Krampus himself in our selfie area!\n\n🖤Guest Wellness & Harm Redu
 ction: A community-led harm reduction collective will be providing a dedic
 ated safe space at the event where guests can take a break\, recharge\, an
 d access community-centered support throughout the night.\n\nVoid soundsys
 tem provided by Royal Sound & Lighting\, Visuals by Pineapple Visions.\n\n
 Come dressed to impress\, dance and celebrate the holidays with us!
LOCATION:Shady Oak Barrel House
URL:https://www.bandsintown.com/e/109054323?app_id=pkvts0on0m&came_from=28
 7&utm_medium=api&utm_source=partner_api&utm_campaign=event
